<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/evaluates> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/evaluates> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#inverseOf> <http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/isEvaluatedBy> .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/evaluates> <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> "\n    :my-funding-agency a frapo:FundingAgency ;\n        frapo:evaluates :my-funding-application .\n    \n    :my-funding-application a frapo:FundingApplication .\n    " .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/evaluates> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The relation between an agent and an entity which that agent evaluates, for example a funding agency that is evaluating a grant application to determine whether the proposed project is worthy of funding, or a publisher evaluating a manuscript to determine whether it is suitable for publication."@en .
<http://purl.org/cerif/frapo/evaluates> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "evaluates"@en .
